// Shared, read-only package/config data model (#367, D-PRODUCT-SPLIT1=C).
// Manifest/lock/store/ref/workspace/script data and compiler-facing binding
// generation live here; provider/network/shell engines belong to Jetpack.
// The compiler imports this layer to resolve already-realized packages without
// depending on Jetpack's engine.

